<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rexall Sundown cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rexall Sundown cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everen Securities Inc said Friday it cut its near-term rating on Rexall Sundown Inc to underperform from market perform. Its long-term rating remains market perform.</p>
<p>-- The near-term rating was cut based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- Rexall Sundown shares were up 1/16 at 34-5/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
